# The Docker build context is the repository ROOT (see docker-compose.yml and
# the Dockerfile, the only one). This root .dockerignore is therefore the only
# one that applies. Keep the context small and free of local data, secrets and
# whatever a previous build or test run left lying around.
.git
docs
data
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.e2e-data*
**/.env*
